# Reference Referral: Public Library Humanities Questions in California's Reference Network.

**Authors:** Roberts, Kay

## Abstract
Describes the process of question referral in California's second-level reference centers where questions are referred by public librarians, and provides examples of questions and sources typical of humanities research. Topics include the varied clientele and the use of databases, reference files, library collections, organizations, special collections, and experts. (LRW)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ496523

